      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 1461.1,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 208186281,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 937859570,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 复杂长程任务中缺乏可跨任务复用的操作流程记忆，导致智能体每次面对相似任务都要从头试错探索；\n2. 程序记忆在持续积累过程中缺乏动态纠错与失效淘汰机制，错误或过时的旧工作流留在库中持续误导后续执行。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 复杂长程任务中缺乏可跨任务复用的操作流程记忆，导致智能体每次面对相似任务都要从头试错探索；\n2. 程序记忆在持续积累过程中缺乏动态纠错与失效淘汰机制，错误或过时的旧工作流留在库中持续误导后续执行。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
