      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 输入构成",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 输入构成",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 743.1,
      "width": 1623.0,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1772001840,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1227728752,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 历史任务指令（query）、完整交互探索轨迹（状态—动作—环境反馈序列）及环境执行成败奖励信号（reward ∈ [0, 1]）；\n2. 程序记忆库中已存储的现存工作流条目及累计命中次数（hit）与引导成功次数（success）统计计数。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 历史任务指令（query）、完整交互探索轨迹（状态—动作—环境反馈序列）及环境执行成败奖励信号（reward ∈ [0, 1]）；\n2. 程序记忆库中已存储的现存工作流条目及累计命中次数（hit）与引导成功次数（success）统计计数。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
