      "text": "4. 存储形式与跨模型迁移特性",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 存储形式与跨模型迁移特性",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 1299.1,
      "width": 1611.8,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 259907006,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 11386159,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 存储形式：结构化文本 + 向量数据库；\n• 跨模型迁移：强模型（GPT-4o）构建的程序记忆库可直接迁移挂载给轻量小模型（Qwen2.5-14B）复用，显著提分并减步。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 存储形式：结构化文本 + 向量数据库；\n• 跨模型迁移：强模型（GPT-4o）构建的程序记忆库可直接迁移挂载给轻量小模型（Qwen2.5-14B）复用，显著提分并减步。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
